# Android native build output.
#
# ⚠️ 161 MB and ~210 files of CMake cache, and every one of them is wrong the
# moment it leaves this machine: CMakeCache.txt and the .cmake/api replies hold
# ABSOLUTE paths to this NDK, this SDK and this checkout, and .ninja_deps /
# .ninja_log / *.bin are rewritten by every build — so they show up as modified
# in `git status` after any `flutter build`, forever.
#
# whisper.cpp is compiled from the sources in android/src/whisper/, which ARE
# tracked. Nothing here is needed to reproduce a build.
/android/.cxx/
/android/build/
/android/.gradle/
/ios/.symlinks/
/example/
